{
  "_note": "PROXY reference questions written by the developer from the synthetic flows (T6.1). Replace or extend with the questions the annotation team normally asks. A topic matches a generated question when the question text contains at least one word/phrase from EVERY group (case-insensitive). ask_once=true: the topic must be covered by a FLOW-scope question.",
